{"id":"683b778af72202b5","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-closure-tree.md","title":"任意点集的闭包与前缀树","display":"df-closure-tree — 任意点集的闭包与前缀树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-closure-tree","aliases":["20-df-closure-tree"],"display":"df-closure-tree — 任意点集的闭包与前缀树","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 14.1.5(i)","source_printed_pages":[213],"source_pdf_pages":[242],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]","[[20-df-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-closure-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-closure-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closure-tree — 任意点集的闭包与前缀树"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 14.1.5(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；新树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A\">\\(T_A\\)</span> 和闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 由下文定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-tree}\\vdash\nT_A:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline A:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ A\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n]\\ne\\varnothing\\}=[T_A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-tree}\\vdash\nT_A:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline A:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ A\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n]\\ne\\varnothing\\}=[T_A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两者由分离公理从明确集合载体中构成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A\">\\(T_A\\)</span> 向下闭合且每个节点可沿某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 成员无限延伸；因此它已被剪为路径节点树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\">\\(\\overline A\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，其补集是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不交的柱并，故闭。任何包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的闭集若遗漏 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\overline A\">\\(X\\in\\overline A\\)</span>，其开补集有与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不交的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 邻域，矛盾；所以此集合确为最小闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时二者都为空。这里没有给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A\">\\(T_A\\)</span> 普通可计算性。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 213 / PDF 242。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure-tree}\\vdash\nT_A:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\overline A:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ A\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n]\\ne\\varnothing\\}=[T_A].","display":true},{"tex":"T_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T_A","display":false}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8485bd5a48a9fe0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-closure-tree]] — 章 14；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-closure-tree]]"}],"outgoing":["ef101d71722ee067","93a810534b87b0f9"]}